	)
	(text "Decoupling Caps for the STM 32.\n- All power pins get a 0.1uF capacitor\n- Additional 4.7uF on a VDD\n- Additional 1uF on VDDA\n\nSee page 71 of STM datasheet for more details and alternative schemes\n"
